# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5, cuda
# An output leaves the run alone (#233) on a GPU at constant energy and
# under NPT with `work = "EXACT"`: in the deterministic mode the run with
# `[output] observables`, the free-energy file, the pull file, an energy
# file, and a trajectory ends in the state of the run without them, bit for
# bit, with the rows of its log, in mixed precision; for the rows of the log
# at the end only as well (D204).
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/output_independence.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU mdir %t Mixed NVE NPT-EXACT | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: GPU Mixed NVE: {{[0-9]+}} builds of the neighbor structure in 40 steps
# CHECK-SAME: compared files, rows-at-end
# CHECK: GPU Mixed NPT-EXACT: {{[0-9]+}} builds
# CHECK-SAME: compared files, rows-at-end
# CHECK: GPU Mixed mdir run: the outputs leave the final state and the rows of the log as they are without them, in 2 ensembles
# CHECK: output independence passed
